From 24281f27b00b7aea051ea453f3ff3f0eeba79f37 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 23:52:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Hooktheory realism modes + dialog, progression tools, MIDI
 input, speed trainer

- hooktheory: 2-chord context scoring, rare floor vs no-data, weighted
  skeleton sampling, realism modes (score/conventional/balanced/adventurous),
  shared realismPass, 401 expiry, live smoke test; UI moved to hooktheoryui.js
  with a masked-password connect dialog
- progtools/voicelead: motion readout, voice-leading smoothing (guitar +
  piano), transpose, capo suggestion, history with A/B, undo and stars
- midiin: Web MIDI chord naming with sustain, to My chords / chord table
- speedtrainer: tempo-ramp loop in the Practice tab with best-tempo tracking
- trainersrs: weight due cards by miss rate; weak spots in trainer stats
- verifier: 19 new checks (65/65)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017dgi9ZSkEeVLeLmotkEwZ8
